 on\\nAges: For children ages 2–6 and their caregivers\\nCategory: Storyt
 ime\\n\\nJoin us in the Crown Family PlayLab for a free\, drop-in PlayDate
  outside in the Rice Native Gardens \, celebrating Pollinator Week among t
 he flowers and trees surrounding the Field Museum!  Families with 2-6 yea
 r olds are invited to a free\, drop-in\, storytime and movement session ho
 sted by the Chicago Public Library (CPL) and our PlayLab staff. Throughout
  this interactive read-aloud\, CPL readers will feature stories about our 
